# Where the project enquiry form posts.
#
# Leave unset for preview mode: the form validates and shows its success
# state, logs the payload to the console, and offers a pre-filled email link.
#
# Set it to any provider that accepts a JSON POST — Formspree, Web3Forms,
# Getform, Basin, Netlify Forms, or your own function — then restart the
# dev server.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill it in. Do not commit .env.local.

# VITE_ENQUIRY_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
